{"ref":"BDB, קֶ֫רַע","hw":"קֶ֫רַע","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫רַע</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.30\">1 K 11:30</a></sup> <strong>torn piece</strong> of garment, <strong>rag</strong>;—pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.30\">1 K 11:30</a> he tore it into twelve <em>pieces</em>, v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.31\">31</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.12\">2 K 2:12</a>; <em>rags</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.21\">Pr 23:21</a> (sign of poverty).","next":"BDB, קָרַץ","prev":"BDB, קָרַע"}